Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:25.00,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.00,0:00:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}《威斯特里亚寓所》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.01,0:01:53.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯考特·艾克尔斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Mr. Scott Eccles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.86,0:01:55.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 加西亚先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Oh, Mr. Garcia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.19,0:01:57.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很抱歉没能立刻认出你来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I'm sorry I did not recognize you at once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.54,0:01:58.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我来帮您拿箱子吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Please allow me to carry your case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.94,0:01:59.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你真太客气了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}That's very civil of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.76,0:02:00.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常感谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Thank you very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.92,0:02:04.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真抱歉在这么一个天气里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I'm sorry if the weather{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.22,0:02:05.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}欢迎您的到来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}has been unkind for your visit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.79,0:02:08.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对你而言 天气也许不好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Unkind for you perhaps{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.46,0:02:10.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但对我们英国人来说 你知道的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}but we British, you know,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.24,0:02:12.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们生命力顽强{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}we're hardy souls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.49,0:02:26.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}萨里县特别有意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}The county of Surrey is particularly interesting{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.06,0:02:34.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我盼望着向您展示{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I'm looking forward to showing you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.12,0:02:37.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我收藏的所有老地图{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}my entire collection of old maps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.28,0:02:39.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有摩尔和欧戈比的作品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I mean there's Moore and Ogelby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.33,0:02:41.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我带来了一两张可以给你看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I got one or two here I can show you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.23,0:02:49.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他以前画的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}He used to draw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.42,0:03:11.40,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.83,0:03:18.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是你家么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}This is your house is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.05,0:03:20.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 请进{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Yes. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.50,0:03:21.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别客气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Your welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.58,0:03:22.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里很不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}It's very nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.22,0:03:27.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 我们必须认为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I suppose Watson we must look upon you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.71,0:03:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是一名作家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}as a man of letters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.03,0:03:34.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么解释“怪诞”一词的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}How do you define the word "grotesque"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.17,0:03:37.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怪诞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Grotesque.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.21,0:03:39.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}奇怪-不同寻常{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Strange-remarkable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.23,0:03:40.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}No, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.60,0:03:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}肯定不只是那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Surely there's more to it than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.77,0:03:45.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有一些潜在含义{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Some underlying suggestion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.96,0:03:49.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}比如悲惨或者恐怖的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}of a tragic or terrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.28,0:03:51.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你回想一下那些事件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}If you cast your mind back to those narratives{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.12,0:03:52.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你那些长期折磨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}with which you've inflicted{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.80,0:03:54.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}公众的文章{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}a long-suffering public,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.65,0:04:00.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会发现“怪诞”一词如此频繁地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}you will see how often the word "grotesque"...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.08,0:04:03.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}同犯罪结合在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}has deepened into the criminal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.67,0:04:09.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I suppose{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.31,0:04:11.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红发会事件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}the affair of the redheaded men{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.64,0:04:14.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}开头相当怪诞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}was grotesque enough at the outset.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.97,0:04:19.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}五个桔核事件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Most grotesque affair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.57,0:04:21.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一直很怪诞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}of the five orange pips.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.07,0:04:22.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 那直接引出一宗谋杀案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Yes, which led straight to a murderous conspiracy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.67,0:04:26.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在这个词… 让我警惕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Now the word puts me on the alert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.06,0:04:28.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}电报里有这个词么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Have you it there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.92,0:04:33.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我遇到一件难以置信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I've just had the most incredible{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.86,0:04:36.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和怪诞之事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and grotesque experience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.63,0:04:40.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可以向您求教么 斯考特·艾克尔斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}May I consult you Scott Eccles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.60,0:04:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}查林十字街邮局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Post-Office, Charring Cross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.12,0:04:45.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}男的还是女的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}A man or woman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.35,0:04:47.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}男的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}A man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.43,0:04:49.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女人不会发这种预付了回电费的电报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}No woman would send a reply-paid telegram.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.83,0:04:52.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她会直接上门来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}She would have come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.53,0:04:54.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你要见他么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Will you see him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.89,0:04:58.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 我亲爱的华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Oh my dear Watson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.44,0:05:04.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道自从我们关押了 卡鲁塞斯上校之后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}you know how bored I've been{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.46,0:05:07.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有多无聊么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}since we locked up Colonel Carruthers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.91,0:05:13.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}生活平淡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Life is commonplace{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.76,0:05:16.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}报纸枯燥无味{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}the newspapers are sterile{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.22,0:05:18.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}冒险和罗曼史似乎从这个罪恶的世上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}audacity and romance seem to have passed forever{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.99,0:05:20.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}永远消失了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}from the criminal world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.80,0:05:22.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我当然要见他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Of course I'll see him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.78,0:05:25.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果我没弄错的话 这位就是我们的委托人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Unless I'm very much mistaken, this is our client.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.82,0:05:27.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.52,0:05:28.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你 哈德森太太{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Thank you, Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.31,0:05:29.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 您是福尔摩斯先生么？- 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}- Well are you Mr. Holmes? - Certainly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.71,0:05:30.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Yes, Mr. Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.35,0:05:32.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我遇到了一件极奇怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I have just had a most singular{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.11,0:05:33.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}极不愉快的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and unpleasant experience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.85,0:05:37.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有生以来还从未有过这样的遭遇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}No way in my life have I been subject to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.27,0:05:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真是奇耻大辱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}to such embarrassment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.02,0:05:40.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}难以容忍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and been placed in such a position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.08,0:05:42.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请坐 斯考特·艾克尔斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Please sit down, Mr. Scott Eccles,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.55,0:05:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这位是我的朋友和同事 华生医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}my friend and colleague Doctor Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.12,0:05:45.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}首先 请问{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}In the first place, my I ask,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.59,0:05:47.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你为什么要来找我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}why you have came to me at all?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.78,0:05:49.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯 先生 这件事看来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Well, sir, it didn't appear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.72,0:05:51.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和警察无关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}to be a matter which concerned the police,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.57,0:05:53.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是 等你听完这件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}yet,when you've heard the facts,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.34,0:05:54.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你肯定同意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}you must admit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.41,0:05:56.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不能就这么算了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I couldn't just leave it where it was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.11,0:05:57.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而对于私家侦探{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Now the private detectives{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.02,0:05:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们这一类人呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}they are a class with whom I'm absolutely,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.86,0:06:01.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不是很感兴趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I have no sympathy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.19,0:06:04.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}坐下 斯考特·艾克尔斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Sit, Mr. Scott Eccles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.49,0:06:11.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}虽然如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Nonetheless,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.77,0:06:13.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我久仰您的大名{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}having heard your name...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.80,0:06:14.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 华生 - 我决定…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}- Watson! - I decided...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.71,0:06:16.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Now in the second place,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.67,0:06:18.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么你不立刻就来？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}why did you not come to me at once?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.88,0:06:19.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.71,0:06:21.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在已经2点15分了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Well it is now a quarter-past two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.52,0:06:25.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的电报是1点发的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Your telegram was dispatched about one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.38,0:06:28.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瞧您这身装扮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}No one could glance at your toilet and attire{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.58,0:06:30.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就会知道您是在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}without seeing that your disturbance dates{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.40,0:06:32.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}起床的时候遇上麻烦的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}from the moment of your waking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.48,0:06:36.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是这样的 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}But you're right, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.29,0:06:39.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从没想过要梳洗一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Yet I never gave a thought to my toilet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.20,0:06:43.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是如此急于逃离那座房子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I was only too glad to get out of such a house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.98,0:06:46.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 不用了 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Oh no, no thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.34,0:06:48.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你看 在我来这之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}You see but I have been running round{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.04,0:06:52.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我四处打听情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}making inquiries before I came here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.36,0:06:55.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我打电话给房屋管理处 你知道的 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I called the house agents, you know, oh yes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.09,0:06:57.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 但他们说… 他们说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}yes, and they said... they said{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.25,0:07:01.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}加西亚先生的房租已经付过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}that Mr. Garcia's rent was paid up all right{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.08,0:07:03.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还说威斯特里亚寓所里一切正常{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and that everything was in order in Wisteria Lodge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.85,0:07:06.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}冷静 冷静 艾克尔斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Then they you'll come, come, sir Eccles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.96,0:07:08.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你和我的朋友华生一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}You know you're like my friend, Watson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.43,0:07:10.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都有个坏习惯 叙述事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}who has the bad habit of telling his stories{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.17,0:07:10.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}老是头尾颠倒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}wrong end foremost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.91,0:07:14.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在 请你… 请你 整理一下思路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Now please, please arrange your thoughts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.68,0:07:16.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}按顺序告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and let me know, in their due sequence,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.94,0:07:20.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}到底发生了什么事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}exactly what those events are,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.26,0:07:22.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么事让你就这样跑出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}which have sent you out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.58,0:07:24.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}头也不梳脸也不刮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}unbrushed and unkempt,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.39,0:07:27.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}靴子和背心的口子也没扣好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}with your dress boots and waistcoat buttoned awry,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.61,0:07:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就这样来寻求建议和帮助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}in search of advice and assistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.47,0:07:34.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是一个单身汉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Well I'm a bachelor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.82,0:07:38.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}由于喜欢社交{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and being of a sociable turn{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.62,0:07:42.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我结识了一大帮朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I cultivate a large number of friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.41,0:07:44.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在最近的一次聚会上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}At the table of one of them recently,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.71,0:07:46.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我认识了一位名叫加西亚的年轻人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I met a young fellow named Garcia,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.68,0:07:48.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个令人愉快的家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}a pleasant chap{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.15,0:07:49.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有西班牙血统{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}of Spanish decent,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.49,0:07:52.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和西班牙大使馆有些联系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}connected in some way with the Embassy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.57,0:07:55.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们发现彼此对测绘地图有共同的兴趣爱好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}We discovered a common interest in cartography{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.95,0:07:57.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或者我是这么认为的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}or so I thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.69,0:07:59.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们研究老地图{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}That's the study of old maps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.88,0:08:02.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们计划追寻五十年前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}The plan was to retrace Surrey as Thomas Mould{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.06,0:08:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯·木得绘制地图的路线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}engraved it some fifty years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.52,0:08:08.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当我昨晚到达的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Well as soon as I arrived yesterday evening{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.12,0:08:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我发觉那里的气氛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I knew something was wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.07,0:08:13.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有些不对劲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}The atmosphere of the place,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.08,0:08:14.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}屋子里昏暗陈旧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}the house was tumbledown,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.82,0:08:16.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}压抑的很{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}depressing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.39,0:08:19.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}加西亚告诉我说他有个很棒的厨子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Garcia told me he had a wonderful cook,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.57,0:08:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那人有一半西班牙血统 是他在旅途中认识的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}a half breed he had picked up on his travels{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.75,0:08:24.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是那天的晚餐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}but the dinner,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.53,0:08:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如此糟糕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}well it was so ill-prepared{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.27,0:08:28.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}服务很不周到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and served with such bad grace{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.09,0:08:30.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}饭菜难以下咽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}that it was barely edible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.48,0:08:33.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我向你保证那天晚上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I can assure you that there were many times{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.87,0:08:35.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有好几次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}in the course of the evening{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.81,0:08:38.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我真想找个借口离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I wished I could have invented some excuse to leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.78,0:08:39.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}What did you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.50,0:08:40.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}房间非常棒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Well the rooms is fascinating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.72,0:08:42.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}约翰·罗戈比{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}John Rogglbe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.30,0:08:43.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么很热门咯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Across the heat then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.60,0:08:47.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不仅热门 伙计 可以说是风靡全郡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Wasn't just heat lad, it was all over the county.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.01,0:08:51.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你没有什么不舒服吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I tell you, you feeling all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.40,0:08:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.60,0:08:53.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.83,0:08:54.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嘿 嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Please, Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.99,0:08:56.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给客人再上点酒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Some more wine for our guest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.57,0:08:58.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.35,0:09:05.86,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.55,0:09:25.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有客人要来么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Are we expecting company?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.90,0:09:32.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以的话 我还想喝点那个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I would like a drink of that if it's possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.36,0:09:49.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他没有对字条上的内容{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}And he made no remark{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.66,0:09:51.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说些什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}as to the contents of the note?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.68,0:09:54.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}None.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.41,0:09:56.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但从那时起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}But for that moment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.26,0:09:58.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他收起了谈话时的所有伪装{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}he gave up all pretence at conversation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.93,0:10:00.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就坐在那儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}He just sat there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.43,0:10:02.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不停地抽着雪茄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}smoking these endless cigarettes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.03,0:10:06.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大概11点的时候 我很高兴可以去睡觉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}About eleven I was glad to go to bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.14,0:10:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}2小时以后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Two hours later{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.50,0:10:09.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他来到我房间里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}he looked in at my door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.76,0:10:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你有摇铃叫我么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Did you ring?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.10,0:10:12.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有摇铃么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Did I ring?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.46,0:10:15.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 别起来 现在快1点了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Awe, please don't wake up it's nearly one o'clock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.61,0:10:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}继续睡吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Please go back to sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.39,0:10:18.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.99,0:10:22.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}接下来就到最关键的部分了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}And now I come to the amazing part of my tale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.86,0:10:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当我醒来的时候 天已经大亮了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}When I woke it was broad daylight,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.93,0:10:35.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快9点了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}nearly nine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.75,0:10:38.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我特别交待他们 要在8点钟叫醒我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I had particularly asked to be called at eight,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.31,0:10:39.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以我很震惊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}so I was very much astonished{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.95,0:10:41.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎能如此健忘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}at this forgetfulness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.33,0:10:45.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我说有人在吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I say is anybody here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.39,0:10:47.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想要点热水{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I'd like some hot water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.85,0:10:49.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我摇铃叫仆人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I rang for the servant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.56,0:10:51.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有回应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}There was no response.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.61,0:10:53.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有人吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Somebody?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.14,0:11:01.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我说有人服务没{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I say is there a servant available.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.06,0:11:09.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}This is damnable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.46,0:11:19.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我把房间挨个找了一遍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I went from room to room,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.44,0:11:21.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都是空的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}all were deserted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.76,0:11:23.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}主人房也一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Even my host room,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.41,0:11:25.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}床铺没人睡过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}the bed had never been slept in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.59,0:11:26.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}外国主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Foreign host,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.93,0:11:28.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}外国仆人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}foreign footman,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.29,0:11:29.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}外国厨子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}foreign cook,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.83,0:11:32.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在晚上全消失了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}all vanished in the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.36,0:11:33.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您的经历{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Your experience is,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.97,0:11:35.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就我看来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}so far as I know,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.54,0:11:37.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常奇特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}perfectly unique.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.36,0:11:40.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有什么别的情况么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Now what else can you tell me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.05,0:11:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恩 我异常愤怒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Well, I was furious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.12,0:11:46.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我收拾了行李{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I packed my bags{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.55,0:11:48.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}摔上大门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and I banged the front door behind me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.67,0:11:51.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出发去伊舍了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and I set out for Esher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.34,0:11:53.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}后来我给 艾伦兄弟的地产经纪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Then I called at Allan Brothers',{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.83,0:11:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}打电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}the land agents,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.78,0:11:57.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我发现这栋别墅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and found it was from them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.76,0:12:00.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是向他们租来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}that the villa had been rented.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.09,0:12:01.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}租的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Rented?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.22,0:12:02.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Well you see{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.03,0:12:04.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不敢相信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I couldn't believe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.71,0:12:06.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们消失了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}that they had gone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.14,0:12:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就为了作弄我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}simply to make a fool of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.98,0:12:11.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想他们肯定是想赖租金{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I thought, you know, it must be the rent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.89,0:12:14.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}but I was wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.31,0:12:17.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}房屋经纪人感谢我的提醒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}See the agent thanked me for my warning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.29,0:12:19.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并告诉我说租金已经预付了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}but said that the rent had been paid in advance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.61,0:12:21.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我猜也许是大使馆付的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}By the Spanish embassy I imagine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.87,0:12:24.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我给西班牙大使馆打电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I called at the Spanish embassy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.67,0:12:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们不认识这些人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}The man is unknown to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.20,0:12:29.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也问了把他们介绍给我认识的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I also asked my friend who introduced us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.39,0:12:31.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他和我一样不了解他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and he seemed to know less about Garcia than I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.92,0:12:35.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在 这座房子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Now, this house,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.83,0:12:40.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}威斯特里亚公寓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Wisteria Lodge,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.91,0:12:43.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想它是否和你离开时一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I wonder if it's still as you left it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.42,0:12:46.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想什么呢 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}What's troubling you, Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.76,0:12:47.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}厄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.02,0:12:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恐怕等我们到那儿的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Well I fear some mundane explanation of the events{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.65,0:12:53.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许会发现原因其实很简单{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}may await us upon our arrival.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.73,0:12:54.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}It's possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.42,0:12:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}感谢我们的好运气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}We can thank our lucky fate,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.44,0:12:57.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把我们从百无聊赖中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}which will rescue us for a few hours{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.00,0:13:01.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拯救出来几个小时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}from the insufferable fatigues of idleness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.01,0:13:16.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这位先生推荐村里的公牛旅馆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}This gentleman recommends The Bull in the village,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.71,0:13:19.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们可以在那里过夜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}that's if we're to stay overnight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.96,0:13:26.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我问他是否认识加西亚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I asked him if he knew Garcia{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.07,0:13:27.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或者他的仆人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}or his servants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.95,0:13:29.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他认识么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Did he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.42,0:13:31.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不认识{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.24,0:13:34.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}外边没有什么特别的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Nothing unusual about the outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.31,0:13:37.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我们看里面的情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Let's see what the interior holds for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.77,0:13:39.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我希望我们不会因非法侵入{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I don't suppose we could be charged{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.17,0:13:41.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而被起诉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}with housebreaking can we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.93,0:13:53.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么这么乱七八糟的 也不收拾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Who on earth could leave such a mess?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.22,0:13:55.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}的确如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Yes indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.54,0:14:06.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}到屋子里四处看看 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Take a glance around the house, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.43,0:14:19.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.06,0:14:24.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}欢迎您来威斯特里亚公寓 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Welcome to Wisteria Lodge, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.88,0:14:28.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是萨里警队的贝恩斯警长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Inspector Baynes of the Surrey Constabulary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.23,0:14:35.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这位是唐宁警官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}This is Constable Downing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.34,0:14:38.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您是住在李街波帕姆公馆的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}And you are Mr. John Scott Eccles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.36,0:14:40.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}约翰·斯考特·艾克尔斯 先生么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}of Popham House,Lee?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.42,0:14:41.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.29,0:14:43.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯考特·艾克尔斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Mr. Scott Eccles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.89,0:14:47.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们跟了您一个上午了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}we've been following you about all the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.17,0:14:50.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想您是通过电报找到他的吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}You traced him through his telegram, I presume?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.30,0:14:53.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Exactly, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.36,0:14:57.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们在查林十字街邮局发现了他的踪迹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}We picked up the scent at Charring Cross Post-Office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.15,0:14:59.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你想干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}But what'd you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.89,0:15:01.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么跟踪我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}And why did you follow me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.60,0:15:04.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们想要您一份证词 斯考特·艾克尔斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}We wish a statement, Mr. Scott Eccles,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.43,0:15:06.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}关于住在伊舍附近{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}as to the events which led up to the death{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.62,0:15:09.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}威斯特里亚寓所的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}of Mr. Aloysius Garcia,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.49,0:15:13.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阿洛伊修斯·加西亚先生死亡事件的证词{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}of Wisteria Lodge,near Esher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.30,0:15:16.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说死亡？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Dead did you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.37,0:15:17.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的先生 他死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Oh yes sir, he is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.87,0:15:19.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.31,0:15:20.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}But how?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.40,0:15:21.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}意外么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}An accident?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.36,0:15:26.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谋杀 先生 如果世界上发生过谋杀的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Murder, sir, if ever there was one on earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.12,0:15:31.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 上帝啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Good God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.24,0:15:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这太可怕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}This is awful!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.33,0:15:38.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您不会认为我是嫌疑犯吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}You don't mean that I'm suspected?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.86,0:15:42.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生 我们在死者身上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Well, sir, you're note was found{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.28,0:15:44.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}发现了您写的字条{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}on the dead man's body{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.47,0:15:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上面说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and from it we learned{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.14,0:15:48.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你打算昨晚上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}that you had planned to stay here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.33,0:15:50.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在这里过夜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}in this house last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.59,0:15:53.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是这样的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}So I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.32,0:15:55.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在这过夜了 是么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Oh, you did, did you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.89,0:15:57.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.56,0:15:58.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}贝恩斯 我想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Baynes, I mean surely{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.00,0:16:01.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你要的只是一份简单的证词吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}all you need is a simple statement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.53,0:16:04.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 福尔摩斯先生 但是我有责任{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Yes, Mr. Holmes, but it is my duty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.44,0:16:07.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}提醒斯考特·艾克尔斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}to warn Mr. Scott Eccles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.55,0:16:12.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这份证词将作为呈堂证供{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}that it may be used against him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.67,0:16:15.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这位是我的同伴 华生医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Awe, this is my fellow colleague, Dr. Watson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.34,0:16:16.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}贝恩斯警长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Inspector Baynes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.98,0:16:19.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 是的 当然 - 医生 来一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}- Yes of course. - Doctor your attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.56,0:16:23.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯考特·艾克尔斯 先生 您看上去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Mr. Scott Eccles you look as if{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.41,0:16:24.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好像需要喝点酒吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}you could do with a drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.82,0:16:28.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在书房发现了些白兰地 如果你想…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I found some brandy in the library if you think...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.91,0:16:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.67,0:16:36.16,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.46,0:17:16.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我向您保证警长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Well I can assure you, Inspector that, you know,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.54,0:17:20.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我说的每个字都是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}every word I've said it is the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.44,0:17:23.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一定要说的是 斯考特·艾克尔斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I'm bound to say, Mr. Scott Eccles,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.03,0:17:26.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您说的每件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}that everything you've said{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.97,0:17:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和我们注意到的事实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}does agree with the facts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.46,0:17:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都完全一致{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}as they've come to our notice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.99,0:17:36.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}比如说 晚餐时送来的字条{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}For example, the note that arrived during dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.95,0:17:39.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯考特·艾克尔斯先生 这张字条后来怎么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Mr. Scott Eccles what became of the note?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.48,0:17:41.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}加西亚 把它揉成一团{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Well, Garcia rolled it up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.15,0:17:43.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}扔到火里去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and threw it in the fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.38,0:17:45.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对此你有什么要说的么 贝恩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}What do you say to that, Baynes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.53,0:17:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是个带栅栏的壁炉 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}It was a dog-grate, Mr. Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.09,0:17:51.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他扔过头了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}he over pitched it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.06,0:17:56.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在炉子后面找到了 这张没有烧着的字条{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I found this unburned of the back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.02,0:17:58.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您一定把房子搜查得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}You must have made a very careful{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.03,0:18:00.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}十分仔细{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}examination of the house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.74,0:18:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}才能找到这么小的纸条{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}to find a single pellet of paper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.80,0:18:06.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 是的 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Oh, I did, Mr. Holmes, I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.73,0:18:09.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这正是我工作作风{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}It's my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.01,0:18:13.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}字条是写在一张普通的乳黄色{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}The note is written on ordinary cream-laid paper{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.70,0:18:16.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}带水印的纸上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}with a watermark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.13,0:18:18.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它有四分之一张纸那么大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}It's a quarter-sheet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.28,0:18:21.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}用短刃剪刀 剪了两下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}The paper's cut off in two snips{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.43,0:18:24.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}剪下来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}with a short-bladed scissors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.81,0:18:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}折叠两次后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}It's been folded twice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.51,0:18:31.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}用红色的蜡封口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and sealed with scarlet wax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.86,0:18:33.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}字条是送给{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}It's addressed to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.67,0:18:36.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}威斯特里亚公寓的加西亚先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Mr. Garcia, Wisteria Lodge{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.23,0:18:39.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上面写着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and it says{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.34,0:18:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"我们自己的颜色 绿和白"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Our own colors, green and white.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.58,0:18:45.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"绿色开"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Green open,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.77,0:18:47.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"白色关"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}white shut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.82,0:18:49.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"主楼梯"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Main stairs,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.67,0:18:51.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"第一个走廊"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}first corridor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.82,0:18:54.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"右边第七"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}seventh right,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.66,0:18:57.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"绿粗呢"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}green baize.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.53,0:19:00.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"祝成功"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Godspeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.30,0:19:02.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}署名"D"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}D.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.87,0:19:04.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是女人的笔迹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}It's in a woman's writing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.81,0:19:08.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}笔头非常尖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}done with a very sharp-pointed pen,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.64,0:19:12.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是地址是用不同的笔写的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}but the address is either done with a different pen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.02,0:19:14.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或者是别人写的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}or by someone else{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.80,0:19:17.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为字迹更粗重{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}because it's thicker and bolder,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.74,0:19:21.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你看 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}as you may see, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.09,0:19:23.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是一张不同寻常的字条{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}It's a remarkable note.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.75,0:19:25.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我必须得祝贺您{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I really must congratulate you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.63,0:19:27.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}注意到了细节{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}on your attention to detail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.82,0:19:30.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是还要补充一些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}There are a few trifling points{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.83,0:19:32.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小细节{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}which might perhaps be added.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.99,0:19:36.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}字条是用袖口封口的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}The seal is a sleeve-link{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.64,0:19:39.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还会有其他什么东西是这样的形状呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}what else is of such a shape?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.03,0:19:43.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}剪刀是弯头的指甲剪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}The scissors were bent nail scissors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.31,0:19:45.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}虽然剪的两下都不长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Short as the two snips are,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.22,0:19:46.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你还是能清楚地看到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}you can distinctly see{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.90,0:19:49.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每一刀都有一样略弯的曲线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}the same slight curve in each.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.91,0:19:59.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还以为已找到了全部线索了 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I thought I had squeezed it dry, Mr. Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.34,0:20:03.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但显然我还是漏掉了一些东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}but I see there was some still left over after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.55,0:20:09.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我得说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I'm bound to say{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.40,0:20:11.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我并不太明白纸条的意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}that I make nothing of the note{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.72,0:20:15.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我知道有人在搞名堂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}except that there's something's on hand,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.93,0:20:18.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这件事照例{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and a woman, as usual,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.66,0:20:20.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还牵涉到一个女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}is at the bottom of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.72,0:20:30.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}警长 我很高兴你找到了这张纸条{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I'm very glad you found the note, Inspector,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.70,0:20:32.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为它证明了我说的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}because it collaborates my story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.75,0:20:35.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是 你知道 我要说的是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}But, you know, I do beg to point out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.86,0:20:37.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}that I haven't yet heard{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.29,0:20:39.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}加西亚先生发生了什么事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}what has happened to Mr. Garcia,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.38,0:20:42.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或者他家里发生了什么事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}or what has become of his household.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.42,0:20:46.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}加西亚先生么 很容易回答{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}As for Mr. Garcia, that's easily answered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.18,0:20:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今天早上发现他死在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}He was found dead{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.87,0:20:54.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}奥克肖特公有地上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}on Oxshott Common this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.32,0:20:59.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的脑袋被沙袋或类似的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}His head had been beaten to a pulp by a sandbag{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.55,0:21:03.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}打成了肉酱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}or some such object,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.35,0:21:06.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不仅是打破了 简直是稀巴烂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}which had crushed rather than wounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.15,0:21:08.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很明显 他最初{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Apparently he'd been{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.61,0:21:11.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是被人从后面袭击的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}first struck down from behind,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.14,0:21:13.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是凶手在他死后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}but his assailant went on beating him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.98,0:21:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还打了很久{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}long after he was dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.20,0:21:18.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是一次非常残暴的袭击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}It was a very furious assault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.04,0:21:21.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以说是我们见过的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Awe, I mean this activity that we saw{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.00,0:21:23.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最严重的一次行凶了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}has to be approached at the highest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.48,0:21:25.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}发现脚印或其他犯罪线索了么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Were there any footsteps or clues as tothe criminal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.68,0:21:28.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有 还没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}No, no, as yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.05,0:21:30.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}加西亚 被抢劫了么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Had Garcia been robbed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.66,0:21:31.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.37,0:21:34.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有抢劫的迹象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}No sign of robbery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.73,0:21:36.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们的租户好像{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Well our tenants seem to have left{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.34,0:21:38.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么东西也没有留下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}little or nothing behind them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.56,0:21:40.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除了衣服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Apart from the clothes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.71,0:21:42.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}几个烟斗 几本小说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}some pipes, a few novels,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.59,0:21:44.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其中有两本是西班牙语的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}two of them in Spanish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.93,0:22:22.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其中一把不见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}One of them is missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.00,0:22:28.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.77,0:22:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以认为“G”代表加西亚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}We might assume the "G" stands for Garcia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.57,0:22:36.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许是祖传的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Family heirloom perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.30,0:22:38.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}另一把枪不在死者身上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}The other was not on the body{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.94,0:22:40.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在附近也没有找到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}nor has it been found in the vicinity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.06,0:22:43.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我的人还在寻找{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}though my men are still looking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.07,0:22:44.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你想看看房子周围么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Do you wish to look around the house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.38,0:22:45.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}稍稍看一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}A brief look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.28,0:23:04.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Holmes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.39,0:23:07.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Holmes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.71,0:23:11.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Holmes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.05,0:23:57.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Watson!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.84,0:23:58.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看见什么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}What have you seen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.67,0:24:01.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像个魔鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Could have been the devil for all I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.16,0:24:02.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瞪着眼睛从窗外朝里看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Staring eyes at the window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.87,0:24:04.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有黑人特征 像是黑白混血儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Negroid features, mulatto like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.80,0:24:06.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}穿过空地跑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}It's got away across the field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.90,0:24:07.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许这样也好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Maybe just as well{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.59,0:24:09.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想我可能打不过他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I don't think I could have laid hands on him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.02,0:24:12.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 看看这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Awe, look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.41,0:24:15.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果他的身材和脚般配的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}If he is all the same scale as his foot{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.96,0:24:18.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他一定是个巨人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}then he is certainly a giant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.87,0:24:21.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不管他是谁 他想干嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Well whoever he was, whatever he wanted{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.05,0:24:25.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}目前他逃走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}he's gone for the present,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.16,0:24:28.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们要关心更重要的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and we have more important things to attend to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.34,0:24:39.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}唐宁 你留下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Downing, you stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.31,0:24:42.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诸位请跟我到局里一趟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}And you sir shall come to the station with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.84,0:24:45.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 好的 先生 - 我要做份笔录{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}- Yes sir. - And let me have a written statement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.75,0:24:46.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 我立刻就来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Yes certainly I'd come at once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.91,0:24:47.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我希望您不介意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I hope you don't my{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.61,0:24:49.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们一起合作 警长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}collaborating with you Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.05,0:24:50.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很荣幸 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I'd be honored, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.00,0:24:52.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}荣幸之至{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I'd be honored.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.65,0:24:54.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}警长 有没有线索证明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Inspector, is there any clue{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.12,0:24:55.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那人准确的死亡时间么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}as to the exact hour of the man's death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.90,0:24:57.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一点钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}One o'clock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.54,0:24:59.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那时候在下雨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}It rained about that time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.21,0:25:03.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}死亡肯定在下雨之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and the death certainly occurred before the rain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.19,0:25:05.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}No. No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.56,0:25:08.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那绝对不可能 贝恩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}That's perfectly impossible, Mr. Baynes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.96,0:25:11.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不 他的声音很特殊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}No, no, his voice is very unmistakable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.69,0:25:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我发誓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I could swear to it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.02,0:25:15.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个时候在我房间里和我说话的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}that it was he who addressed me in my room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.49,0:25:17.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}at that very hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.43,0:25:19.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他和我说话 你知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Well he spoke to me, you know,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.21,0:25:20.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他有那种可笑的口音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}in that funny accent of his.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.68,0:25:22.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他说就要1点了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}He said he's it's nearly one o'clock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.97,0:25:25.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很好 但是我们要分清不太可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Remarkable but we must not confuse the unlikely{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.95,0:25:28.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和绝不可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}with the impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.36,0:25:32.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}What does he mean of that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.48,0:25:35.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}显然那房子里的人很古怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Certainly some strange people occupy that house,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.62,0:25:37.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.30,0:25:39.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有一个已经死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}One of them is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.11,0:25:40.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是他的同伴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Did some of his companions{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.75,0:25:42.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟着他然后杀了他么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}follow him and murder him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.56,0:25:46.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果是这样的话 我们会在被监视的每个港口抓到他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}If so, we should have them for every port is watched{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.73,0:25:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我不这么认为 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}but my views are different, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.15,0:25:52.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的先生 我有不同的看法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Yes sir, my views are very different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.99,0:25:54.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你很有一套{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}You have a theory?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.63,0:25:57.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要自己干 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}And I'll work it myself, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.40,0:25:58.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你已经名闻天下了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Your name is already made,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.85,0:26:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还在努力中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I have yet to make mine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.83,0:26:02.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我将来会说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and I shall like to be able to say afterwards,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.52,0:26:07.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没有依靠你的帮助 解决了这个案子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}that I solved it without your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.35,0:26:08.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么你走你的阳光道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Then you do follow your path{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.06,0:26:09.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我走我的独木桥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and I will follow mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.74,0:26:10.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再见 斯考特·艾克尔斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Goodbye, Mr. Scott Eccles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.95,0:26:11.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再见 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Goodbye, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.91,0:26:13.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯考特·艾克尔斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Scott Eccles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.63,0:26:16.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们研究下字条吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Let us consider this note.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.58,0:26:18.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这牵涉到一位女士么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Is there a woman involved?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.26,0:26:20.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嫉妒的丈夫？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}A jealous husband?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.34,0:26:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝保佑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Godspeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.67,0:26:25.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝保佑D 她会成为我们的引路人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Godspeed D, that must be our guide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.71,0:26:27.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个男子是个西班牙人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}The man was a Spaniard{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.14,0:26:31.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我猜“D”代表多洛蕾斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I suggest that the "D" stands for Delores.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.14,0:26:33.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它是常用的西班牙妇女的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}It's a common female name in Spain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.88,0:26:36.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}西班牙人之间会用西班牙语通信的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}A Spaniard would write to a Spaniard in Spanish,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.20,0:26:38.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.71,0:27:03.89,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.60,0:27:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.02,0:27:13.33,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.03,0:27:47.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亨德森庄园… 海伊·盖布尔…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Henderson, High Gable,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.79,0:27:49.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}乔治·福利奥特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}George Ffolliott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.92,0:28:07.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.52,0:28:10.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看看我发现了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Look what I've found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.15,0:28:14.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从灌木丛里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}In the bush.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.98,0:28:17.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Excellent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.79,0:29:42.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I'm terribly sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.23,0:29:45.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我好像…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I've seemed to have...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.34,0:29:53.01,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.40,0:29:55.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你侵入了我们的住所{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}You are trespassing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.50,0:29:57.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常抱歉 我迷路了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I'm terribly sorry. I've seemed to have lost my direction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.18,0:29:59.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们老是这么好奇…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Is it your custom to wonder...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.13,0:30:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 雷菲尔德医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Awe, Doctor Rayfield,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.13,0:30:04.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的朋友和制图伙伴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}my friend and fellow cartographer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.76,0:30:06.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Yes indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.11,0:30:08.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你那么认真地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}You were so engrossed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.17,0:30:09.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}找寻一条通往{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}in trying to chase the bridal path{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.98,0:30:14.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}已消失的圣玛丽村的结婚路线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}to a now vanished Hamlet of Obligor St Mary{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.70,0:30:16.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因此我们分开了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}that we mislaid each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.07,0:30:18.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}由于来见亨德森先生有点晚了 我想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}And since we're late for Mr. Henderson, I thought,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.59,0:30:19.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很高兴你找到这儿了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I'm so glad you found your way here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.91,0:30:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Well I very much regret that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.64,0:30:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亨德森先生今天很忙不能见您{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Mr. Henderson is too busy to see you today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.65,0:30:27.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 卢卡斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}No Lucas,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.15,0:30:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要见他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I will see them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.24,0:31:01.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.66,0:31:13.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们拜访的目的是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}The purpose of our visit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.82,0:31:18.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想咨询一下海伊·盖布尔的历史{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}is to inquire into the history of High Gable,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.26,0:31:19.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们相信英国内战以来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}which we believe has an{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.80,0:31:22.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里有一段迷人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}intriguing and blood fested past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.12,0:31:25.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但充满血雨腥风的过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Since the days of the English civil war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.61,0:31:29.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对此我一无所知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I would have no knowledge of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.27,0:31:31.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只是个新近的侵略者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I'm only a recent invader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.23,0:31:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是书房里可能会有些过去的资料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}But there are local records in the library.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.22,0:31:41.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这房子里没有发现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}There are no records of any past{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.51,0:31:44.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}任何过去的纪录{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}found in this house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.40,0:31:52.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我明白了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.14,0:31:59.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么我不再打扰你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Then I will detain you no more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.56,0:32:01.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}日安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Good day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.09,0:32:15.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我以为你去伦敦了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I thought you were in London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.70,0:32:17.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是上午在那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}For the morning only.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.64,0:32:19.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}由于和往常一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Well with your usual reluctance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.15,0:32:20.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不愿意告诉我你的想法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}to confide your thoughts to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.83,0:32:23.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我分析了一下情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I exercised my own mind in the matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.42,0:32:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的名单上圈了两个名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}You'd circled two names on your list,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.68,0:32:27.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亨德森 和 海伊·盖布尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Henderson and High Gable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.29,0:32:29.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恩 其他的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Well the others are,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.20,0:32:31.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以说 都是有名望的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}per say, respectable people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.25,0:32:33.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和浪漫史沾不上边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Far aloof from romance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.24,0:32:35.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除了这位 亨德森{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}but this man, Henderson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.22,0:32:37.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是一位特别的人物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}but he's a very singular creation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.95,0:32:39.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}的确如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Yes indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.56,0:32:40.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你也可能注意到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}As you may have noticed...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.89,0:32:42.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不喝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}no tea for me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.16,0:32:43.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}屋子有两翼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}the house is double winged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.97,0:32:47.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一边住着仆人 另一边住着主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}One side the servants the other side the family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.22,0:32:49.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}中间只有一扇连接的门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}There is one single connecting door{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.61,0:32:51.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}用来给亨德森家人上菜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}for the Henderson family meals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.87,0:32:53.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信在我们拜访的如此短暂的时间里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I'm sure you couldn't have observed all that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.20,0:32:54.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不可能注意到这些的 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}in the short time we there, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.43,0:32:56.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我通过流言蜚语和被解雇的仆人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I was looking for evidence in gossip{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.28,0:32:57.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}寻找证据{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and discharged servants{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.85,0:32:59.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很幸运地找到一位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and I was lucky to enough to find one{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.59,0:33:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他被专横的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}who had been sacked{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.83,0:33:02.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}主人亨德森解雇了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}by his imperious master Henderson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.84,0:33:05.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并且饱受他的暴虐之苦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and a victim of violent temper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.85,0:33:07.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们的亨德森小姐们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Now the Henderson girls,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.29,0:33:08.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是我们遇见过的那两位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}who we encountered,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.03,0:33:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有一位家庭教师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}have a governess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.12,0:33:13.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伯内特小姐 一位英国女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}A Miss Burnet, an English woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.13,0:33:15.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很奇怪的是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Here is the very singular fact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.53,0:33:16.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谋杀案之后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}She has not been seen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.00,0:33:18.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她再也没出现过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}since the night of the murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.54,0:33:19.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她彻底消失了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}She has utterly vanished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.00,0:33:22.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我见过她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I've seen her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.43,0:33:23.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}肯定是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Of course,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.07,0:33:25.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我见过她 她还活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I've seen her and she is alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.88,0:33:28.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我看见她站在海伊·盖布尔的窗户前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I saw her at the window at High Gable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.03,0:33:32.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝啊 被囚禁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}My God a prisoner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.14,0:33:34.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那可怕的女孩们袭击我的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}She slipped my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.88,0:33:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我看见她了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}The moment those awful girls descended upon me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.50,0:33:41.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她还活着 我见到她了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}She is alive, I've seen her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.40,0:33:48.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就是我看见和追过的那个男人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}That's the man I saw and chased.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.69,0:33:51.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}贝恩斯抓错人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Baynes has arrested the wrong man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.39,0:33:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 快点 我们必须阻止他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Now Watson, quickly, we must stop him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.73,0:34:08.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是凶手么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Is he the murderer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.45,0:34:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他杀了西班牙人吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Did he kill a Spaniard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.43,0:34:13.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们在哪里抓到他的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Where did you capture him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.68,0:34:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这人是受害者的厨子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}This man is the murdered man's cook{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.79,0:34:18.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他在案发当晚失踪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}who disappeared on the night of the crime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.78,0:34:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们相信房子里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}We believe there were valuables{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.55,0:34:22.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}存有贵重物品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}left in the house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.13,0:34:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这就是引出了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and that there abstraction{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.80,0:34:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}作案动机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}was the motive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.51,0:34:27.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有人看见他曾经{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}The man had been seen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.08,0:34:28.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出现在屋子周围{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}in the vicinity of the house once before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.59,0:34:30.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第二次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}The second time,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.91,0:34:35.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}抓牢他 希金斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}subdue him Higgins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.60,0:34:40.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第二次 我们留守的人抓到他了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}The second time we let a man escape for him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.31,0:34:43.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在把他送交地方官之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}we shall be applying for remand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.15,0:34:45.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们要申请遣送{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}when the prisoner's brought before the magistrate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.51,0:34:46.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}目前就这些情况 先生们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}That will be all for now, gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.01,0:34:48.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常感谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Thank you very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.55,0:34:49.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是在路上吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Was it on the way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.89,0:34:51.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们在哪里抓到他的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Where did you capture him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.29,0:34:52.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}贝恩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Baynes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.00,0:34:54.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不认为你走对路了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I am not convinced that you're on the right line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.91,0:34:56.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 不想你错的太离谱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Mr. Holmes doesn't want you to commit yourself too far{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.72,0:34:58.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除非你有确凿把握{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}unless you're sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.43,0:35:03.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 你们真是好人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Oh, you're very kind gentlemen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.22,0:35:06.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我们有协议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}but we did agree{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.57,0:35:09.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}各行其事 对么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}to work on our own lines didn't we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.95,0:35:12.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这就是我所做的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}And that's what I'm doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.69,0:35:17.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}欢迎你们来我的新闻发布会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}You're welcome always to my news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.10,0:35:19.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这家伙壮得像匹拉车的马{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}This fellow is as strong as a carthorse{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.84,0:35:21.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和魔鬼一样凶猛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and fierce as the devil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.82,0:35:24.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在被制服之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}He nearly bit off Constable Downing's thumb{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.03,0:35:27.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他几乎咬掉了唐宁警官的大拇指{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}before they managed to master him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.94,0:35:29.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他几乎不会说英语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}He speaks hardly any English{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.02,0:35:34.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除了咕哝声 我们从他嘴里问不出什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and we can get nothing out of him but grunts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.78,0:35:38.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你认为你有证据{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}And you think that you have evidence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.09,0:35:40.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}证明他杀了他的雇主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}that he murdered his late master?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.79,0:35:44.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没这么说 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I didn't say so, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.62,0:35:48.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没这么说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I didn't say so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.79,0:35:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们都有自己的小窍门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}We all have our own little ways.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.17,0:35:55.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你走你的阳光道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}You will go yours{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.63,0:35:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我走我的独木桥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and I will go mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.17,0:35:59.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就是协议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}That was the agreement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.91,0:36:01.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就这么办吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}So be it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.18,0:36:06.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想贝恩斯终究会摔个大跟头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I think Baynes is riding for the fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.81,0:36:09.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我同意你的观点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I would have to agree with you there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.03,0:36:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道我们面临的困难 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}You appreciate our difficulty, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.39,0:36:34.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们没有申请保释的理由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}There's nothing upon which we can apply for a warrant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.67,0:36:36.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在我们尊敬的警长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}And with our worthy Inspector{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.49,0:36:38.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把嫌犯抓到之后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}making his arrests{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.09,0:36:39.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}地方官只会认为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}our theory would seem fantastic{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.65,0:36:41.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们的推理是荒谬的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}if laid before the magistrate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.08,0:36:43.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你还是认为那位女士有生命危险么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Yet you think the lady's in danger of her life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.29,0:36:44.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.73,0:36:46.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我确信这一点 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I'm sure of it Watson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.44,0:36:48.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们得靠自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}therefore we must take{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.21,0:36:51.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来伸张正义了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}the law into our own hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.58,0:37:02.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}左边最上面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Top left bay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.88,0:37:05.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们可以从外屋进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}We could reach it from that outhouse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.66,0:37:54.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.63,0:38:10.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们往火车站去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}They're heading for the station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.47,0:38:11.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们跟着马车去伦敦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}We'll follow the coach to London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.50,0:38:12.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.57,0:39:30.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}停下火车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Stop the train.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.91,0:39:32.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}停下火车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Stop the train.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.08,0:39:34.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}停下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.11,0:39:58.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么会这样 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Why, Mr. Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.35,0:40:01.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你给了我所有我想要的证据{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}you have given me the very evidence I wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.78,0:40:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们一开始是站在同一起跑线上的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}We were both on the same scent from the start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.04,0:40:06.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你也在追查亨德森么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Were you after Henderson too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.71,0:40:08.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是这样的 你先到那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Quite so well, you first{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.52,0:40:11.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}后来 华生医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and then Doctor Watson here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.74,0:40:13.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}爬过海伊·盖布尔的树篱笆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}came crawling through the under growth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.72,0:40:15.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}at High Gable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.29,0:40:17.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那时候我正在一棵大树上观察你们呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I was up a tree observing you both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.86,0:40:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}问题的关键是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}It was just a question{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.96,0:40:21.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁先拿到证据{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}of who got the evidence first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.57,0:40:25.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你为什么要抓那个混血儿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Why did you arrest the mulatto?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.16,0:40:29.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信这位自称亨德森的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Well I was sure that Henderson, as he calls himself,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.08,0:40:31.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}发觉自己受怀疑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}felt he was suspected{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.09,0:40:32.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他在认为自己仍处于危险中时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and he would make no move{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.87,0:40:34.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是不会采取任何行动的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}so long as he thought he was in danger{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.99,0:40:38.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以我故意抓错人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}so I arrested the wrong man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.02,0:40:40.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}知道吗 警官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}You know you will rise high{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.66,0:40:42.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你一定会步步高升的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}in your profession Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.58,0:40:43.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你颇具警察的本能和直觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}You have instinct and intuition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.74,0:40:46.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多谢夸奖 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Thank you, Mr. Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.44,0:40:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是没有伯内特小姐的证词{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}but we can't arrest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.17,0:40:51.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们不能实行抓捕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}without Miss Burnet's evidence can we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.81,0:40:53.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 她过一会儿就可以告诉你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Oh she'll be able to give you that in a moment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.03,0:40:56.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我亨德森到底是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}but tell me who is this man Henderson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.00,0:40:58.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是唐·穆里洛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}He's Don Murillo,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.64,0:41:01.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也叫圣佩德罗之虎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}known as the Tiger of San Pedro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.45,0:41:05.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}中美洲最危险的人之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}One of the most dangerous men out of Central America.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.35,0:41:06.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Oh indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.83,0:41:09.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最残酷和嗜血的暴君{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Most elude and blood thirsty tyrant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.29,0:41:11.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他对一个善良的民族施加{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Who imposed his earliest vices{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.47,0:41:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}残暴的统治长达12年之久{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}upon a caring people for almost twelve years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.40,0:41:22.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是不是圣佩德罗的绿白旗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Was it the San Pedro colors green and white{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.71,0:41:23.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}提示了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}that first put you onto it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.86,0:41:25.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 我还去了趟伦敦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}That and my visit to London{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.79,0:41:27.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拜访了外交部里的西班牙大使{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}to the Spanish embassy in the foreign office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.10,0:41:31.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还是您来说吧 这是您的案子 警长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Now please this is your case, Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.52,0:41:35.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}五年前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Five years ago{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.01,0:41:38.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}爆发了反对这位暴君的起义{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}there was a rising against the tyrant{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.99,0:41:40.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当人们冲进穆里洛的宫殿的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}but it was an empty palace{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.70,0:41:41.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}发现已经人去楼空了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}they stormed on Murillo,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.00,0:41:42.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的秘书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}his secretary,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.80,0:41:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}两个孩子 还有一切财物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}two children and all the wealth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.41,0:41:49.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都用船运走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}had escaped by ship{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.69,0:41:51.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并且从此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and from that moment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.16,0:41:54.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们从地球上消失了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}they disappeared from the face of the earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.10,0:41:55.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的新身份{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}His identity has been a subject{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.99,0:41:59.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}成为欧洲报纸常谈论的题材{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}of constant comment in the European press.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.42,0:42:02.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们一年前发现了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}We discovered him a year ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.57,0:42:06.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伯内特小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Miss Burnet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.60,0:42:09.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么会牵扯进来的 伯内特小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}How came you into this matter Miss Burnet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.86,0:42:13.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一位英国女士竟卷入这样一宗谋杀案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}An English lady in such a murderous affair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.18,0:42:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为这世界上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Because there is no other way in the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.90,0:42:17.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}找不到另一种方式来伸张正义{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}by which justice can be gained.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.64,0:42:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多年前圣佩德罗血流成河的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}What does the law of England care about{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.14,0:42:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或在这个人用船偷运走我们的财富的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}the rivers of blood shed so many years ago in San Pedro{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.55,0:42:31.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}英国法律起到了什么用呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}or the shipload of treasure that this man has stolen from us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.49,0:42:34.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对于你们而言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}To you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.20,0:42:39.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些就像是发生在其他星球上的罪行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}they're like crimes committed on some other planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.53,0:42:43.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我们却了解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}We know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.76,0:42:49.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我真正的名字叫希格诺拉·维克特·杜兰拖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}My real name is Signora Victor Durando.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.18,0:42:52.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我丈夫是圣佩德罗驻伦敦的大使{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}My husband was the minister of San Pedro in London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.72,0:42:55.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们在那里结识并结婚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}He met and married me there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.51,0:43:03.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是世上少有的品格高尚的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}A nobler man never lived upon the earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.04,0:43:12.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不幸的是 穆里洛觉得我丈夫对他不忠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Unhappily, Murillo heard of his exodus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.08,0:43:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}找了些托辞把他召回国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and recalled him on some pretext,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.96,0:43:20.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并枪杀了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and shot him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.63,0:43:22.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}由于…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}by a stroke of...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.61,0:43:24.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有预感{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}of premonition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.66,0:43:28.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我丈夫拒绝带我一起回国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}My husband had refused to take me with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.21,0:43:31.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}后来这个魔鬼垮台了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Then came the downfall of the monster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.91,0:43:34.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他像你们说的那样逃走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}He escaped as you have described.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.27,0:43:36.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是许多生命被他毁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}But the many whose lives he had ruined,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.46,0:43:38.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}许多人的挚爱在他手里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}whose loved ones had suffered torture{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.07,0:43:39.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}受尽折磨而死去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and death at his hands,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.07,0:43:40.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们不会就此罢休的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}would not let the matter rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.24,0:43:42.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们结成一个团体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}We banded ourselves into a society,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.53,0:43:43.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}任务一天没完成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}which should never be dissolved{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.96,0:43:45.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们一天不解散{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}until the work was done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.58,0:43:48.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的任务是混进他家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}It was my part to attach myself to his household{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.01,0:43:51.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}通知其他人他的动向{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and keep the others in touch with his movements.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.74,0:43:54.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要保住家庭女教师的职位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I secured the position as governess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.83,0:44:00.62,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.70,0:44:01.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他根本不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}He little knew that the woman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.31,0:44:03.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每天吃饭时面对的女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}who faced him at every meal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.24,0:44:06.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她的丈夫被他迫不及待地杀害了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}was the woman whose husband he had hurried to eternity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.95,0:44:08.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我向他微笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I smiled on him,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.77,0:44:11.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}教育他的孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}did my duty to his children,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.36,0:44:13.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等待机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and bided my time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.45,0:44:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在巴黎我们试过一次 但失败了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}An attempt was made in Paris and failed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.01,0:44:24.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他带着我们在欧洲东拐西绕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}We zigzagged here and there swiftly over Europe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.73,0:44:26.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}甩掉了追踪者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}to throw off our pursuers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.68,0:44:30.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最后回到 海伊·盖布尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and finally returned to High Gable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.10,0:44:32.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}加西亚和他的两位忠实伙伴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Garcia had been waiting there for nearly a year{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.36,0:44:33.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在这里等了近一年了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}with two trusted companions,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.96,0:44:37.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大家心中燃着报仇的火焰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}all fired with the same reasons for revenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.62,0:44:41.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}加西亚是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Who was Garcia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.59,0:44:44.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}费尔南多·加西亚的儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}The son of Fernando Garcia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.56,0:44:47.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣佩德罗最高的神职官之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}One of the former highest dignitaries of San Pedro{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.30,0:44:50.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他也被杀害了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}who was murdered...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.68,0:44:53.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}像你丈夫一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}like your husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.07,0:44:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你送来的字条{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}This note you sent,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.60,0:44:59.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说被拦截了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}you say it was intercepted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.09,0:45:00.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在白天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}During the day{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.32,0:45:02.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}穆里洛非常小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Murillo took every precaution{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.41,0:45:04.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有卢卡斯陪伴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and never went outside{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.25,0:45:06.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从不出门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}without his satellite Lucas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.41,0:45:09.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}甚至在夜里他也很警惕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Even at night the man was forever on the alert{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.45,0:45:12.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}常常变换房间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and continually changed his room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.15,0:45:13.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们约定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}We had arranged{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.07,0:45:16.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我给 加西亚送去最后的指示{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}that I would send Garcia final instructions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.15,0:45:17.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后把门打开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}The doors would be opened{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.69,0:45:19.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并在面朝大路的窗户前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and the signal of a green or white light{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.50,0:45:20.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}点上绿色{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}in a window,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.77,0:45:21.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或白色的灯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}which faced the drive,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.07,0:45:23.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说明一切顺利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}was to give notice if all was safe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.84,0:45:26.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或者推迟行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}or if the attempt had better be postponed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.07,0:45:49.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你给谁写信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}To whom are you writing this letter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.28,0:45:51.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}居然告诉他我今晚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Which describes the room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.47,0:45:55.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要住得房间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}in which I intend to sleep tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.33,0:45:58.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁是你的同伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Who is your confederate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.48,0:46:01.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁是你的同伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Who is your confederate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.90,0:46:04.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的真名是什么 伯内特小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}What is your real name Miss Burnet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.91,0:46:11.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我叫杜兰托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}My name is Durando.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.00,0:46:14.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杜兰托的遗孀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Durandos widow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.21,0:46:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.68,0:46:32.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你现在杀了我吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}You can kill me now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.50,0:46:34.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的命没有什么大不了的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}what is my life worth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.58,0:46:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你已经毁了我爱的一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}you have destroyed everything that I love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.76,0:46:39.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你给谁写信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Who are you writing to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.98,0:46:41.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.56,0:46:42.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不记得了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Don't you remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.99,0:46:45.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 谁？- 他是你害怕的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}- Who? - It's a man you fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.42,0:46:48.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他在等你呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}He's waiting for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.67,0:46:59.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他叫加西亚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}He's Garcia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.47,0:47:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}加西亚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Garcia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.12,0:47:10.81,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.89,0:47:13.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}威斯特里亚公寓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Wisteria Lodge,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.56,0:47:16.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他要把你送进地狱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}he is waiting to dispatch you to hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.43,0:47:18.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你个魔鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}You fiend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.72,0:47:20.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我认识这孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I knew the boy well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.50,0:47:23.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他父亲曾是我最好的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}His father was once my dearest friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.05,0:47:26.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你谋杀了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}You murdered him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.44,0:47:30.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他背叛了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}He betrayed me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.51,0:47:32.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你丈夫也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and so did your husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.48,0:47:41.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在他们派老婆和儿子来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}And now they send the wives and sons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.91,0:47:44.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们永远学不乖吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Will you never learn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.39,0:47:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是不会被打败的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I am indestructible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.67,0:48:02.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}开始他们打算{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}At first they were of a mind{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.21,0:48:03.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把他引进房子里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}to let him into the house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.54,0:48:05.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再把他当作盗窃犯杀死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and kill him as a detected burglar{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.66,0:48:07.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但他们害怕之后的问讯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}but they feared the inquiry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.13,0:48:09.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会向公众暴露他们的身份{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}might publicly expose them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.37,0:48:59.26,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.29,0:50:32.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}加西亚 正义会得到伸张的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Garcia, some day justice will come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.59,0:50:34.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像明天太阳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}That is as certain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.94,0:50:37.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}定会升起一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}as the rise of tomorrow's sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.17,0:50:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我肯定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I have no doubt that my life too{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.19,0:50:51.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也是命悬一线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}hung in the balance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.30,0:50:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大部分时间我被关在房里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Most of the time I was confined to my room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.34,0:50:58.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}受到最残酷的虐待{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Terrorized by the most horrible threats{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.58,0:51:02.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来摧残我的精神{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}to break my spirit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.31,0:51:03.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}偶尔吃了他们下药的食物之后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Occasionally I was allowed out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.99,0:51:08.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们也放我出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}but only when they had first drugged my food{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.40,0:51:09.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就像你们在车站找到我时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}and it was at this state{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.07,0:51:13.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个样子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}that you found me at the station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.35,0:51:17.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很感谢这位好人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}And thanks to this good man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.46,0:51:21.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我永远脱离了他们的魔爪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I am beyond their power forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.37,0:51:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好了警长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Well Inspector,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.08,0:51:30.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}侦查工作结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}our police work is done{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.06,0:51:32.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法律程序才刚刚开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}but our legal work begins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.74,0:51:35.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 福尔摩斯先生 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Exactly, Mr. Holmes, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.17,0:51:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}加西亚的死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Garcia's death{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.57,0:51:38.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}若一个经验老到的律师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}in the hands of a portable lawyer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.28,0:51:41.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会把谋杀说成正当防卫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}could look like an act of self-defense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.18,0:51:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我认为法律不至于这样吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}But I think better of the law than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.58,0:51:44.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正当防卫是一回事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Self-defense is one thing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.05,0:51:46.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是冷血地怀着蓄意谋杀的目的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}but to entice a man in cold-blood{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.06,0:51:48.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去诱骗别人又是另一回事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}with the object of murdering him is another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.74,0:51:51.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不管那个人会给你造成什么危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Whatever danger you fear from him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.20,0:51:53.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想我们会看到正义得到伸张的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I think we shall justice done at the next{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.75,0:51:55.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想你把那个混血儿放了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}I thought you had released the mulatto.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.92,0:51:57.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的先生 他又是个自由人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Yes sir, he's a free man again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.97,0:51:59.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的人跟着逃亡者上火车了么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}And your man is with the fugitives on the train?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.85,0:52:02.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 先生 而且我已经给苏格兰场打电话了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}He is, sir, yes, and I've wired Scotland Yard{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.52,0:52:05.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们会派人在滑铁卢车站{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}to have their men at Waterloo Station{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.49,0:52:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等着他们的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}to receive them, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.58,0:52:10.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我必须要祝贺你 警长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}You know I really must congratulate, Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.69,0:52:12.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无意冒犯 允许我这么说 您的能力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Your powers, if I may so, without offense,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.84,0:52:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}比您的职场运气强{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}are superior to your opportunities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.03,0:52:17.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}Your right, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.80,0:52:20.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在我们蜗居的这个省份{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}In the province as we stagnate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.53,0:52:24.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样一件案子会给人带来机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}{\blur3}a case like this gives a man a chance.{\r}
